  "description": "Garrett O’Bric Property Advisors are delighted to present this generously sized two double bedroom ground floor apartment to the market.\nExceptionally bright and spacious accommodation presented in excellent condition throughout and further benefits from beautifully proportioned, light-filled rooms with a spacious patio balcony.\n\nThe property includes an inviting entrance hall, a generous open plan living kitchen and dining area, two double bedrooms including a master ensuite, and a well-appointed main bathroom. Designated parking included.\n\nSorohan built, this highly desirable development is extremely well maintained with leafy cul de sacs and manicured lawns. Located within minutes of every conceivable amenity including; local shops and cafes, and an exceptional range of both primary and secondary schools and UCD Belfield. \n\nThe property is convenient to Dundrum Town Centre, and Stillorgan Shopping Centre with the fabulous recreational amenities of Deer Park and UCD, with the Luas and the M50, Ranelagh and Dublin City Centre are just minutes away.\nViewings by appointment.\n",
